# Environment Variables

Copy to `.env` in project root and apps as needed.

```bash
# Database
DATABASE_URL=postgresql://postgres:postgres@localhost:5432/puja_commerce

# Brand
NEXT_PUBLIC_BRAND_NAME=MyPavitra
NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=http://localhost:3000
# Production: https://mypavitra.com

# Razorpay (India)
# Leave empty for demo/test checkout (no keys needed)
# Test keys from https://dashboard.razorpay.com/app/keys
NEXT_PUBLIC_RAZORPAY_KEY_ID=
RAZORPAY_KEY_ID=
RAZORPAY_KEY_SECRET=
RAZORPAY_WEBHOOK_SECRET=

# Shiprocket
SHIPROCKET_EMAIL=
SHIPROCKET_PASSWORD=
SHIPROCKET_API_URL=https://apiv2.shiprocket.in

# Search (V1)
MEILISEARCH_HOST=http://localhost:7700
MEILISEARCH_API_KEY=

# Storage (V1)
S3_BUCKET=
S3_REGION=
S3_ACCESS_KEY=
S3_SECRET_KEY=
S3_PUBLIC_URL=

# Analytics
NEXT_PUBLIC_GTM_ID=
```
